```
ROLE: evaluation_prosecutor  VOTE: red
MANDATORY_BASELINES: [{"name": "Incremental-Prefill (vLLM/TGI/SGLang)", "why": "Real production engines stream tokens into the KV cache continuously, naturally eliminating the wait-for-EOF stall.", "repo_or_cite": "Standard vLLM/SGLang chunked prefill architecture"}, {"name": "Dumb-Truncation (N=512)", "why": "Captures 100% of actionable content for 4/5 real tool classes with zero parameter overhead and zero redo risk.", "repo_or_cite": "Standard heuristic"}, {"name": "LLMCompiler", "why": "Overlaps inter-call latency at the DAG level without semantic commit risk.", "repo_or_cite": "Kim et al. 2023, arXiv:2312.04511"}]
STRAWMAN_RISKS: ["Comparing against a 'wait-for-EOF' serialize-then-read stall which ignores modern continuous KV-cache prefill.", "Using artificially slow token streaming rates or unrealistically short reasoning steps to inflate rho >= 1.", "Assuming truncation fails universally when it actually solves 80% of tool classes natively."]   MISSING_METRICS: ["E2E wall-clock latency on an H100 with incremental prefill enabled", "Compute overhead of running the early-commit detector vs. the latency saved"]
KILLER_EXPERIMENT: Run an A/B test measuring end-to-end latency and correctness on an H100 using SGLang's native incremental prefill + N=512 dumb-truncation vs. the proposed early-commit apparatus. Measure the actual wall-clock delta. If the baseline is within 100ms of the early-commit system, the apparatus is definitively dead weight.
RATIONALE: The gate successfully prosecuted the claim's core assumptions and exposed the fatal flaw: the proposal rests entirely on beating a toy "serialize-then-read" baseline. Real production systems use incremental prefill, which inherently absorbs the latency early-commit claims to save. Furthermore, the operating regime necessary for this to pay off (rho >= 1 and front-loaded actionable spans) was empirically proven not to exist in real corpora. Dumb-truncation natively handles the short-tail, and the long-tail (search_rag) is anti-correlated with the required front-loaded structure. The claim solves an artificial bottleneck that vanishes under real baselines. The kill is clean and terminal.
